</table></div></div><div class="" id="claim-lhb-ad30f4b5a494b993"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-evidence">证据</span><span class="claim-source">旧版原文补充</span></div><div id="table-bc97947297945754"><table class="trow">
<tr><th>行业净买强度（bp＝当日榜净买 ÷ 流通市值）</th><th>只数</th><th>净买</th><th>强度</th><th>与主线关系</th></tr>
<tr><td>通用设备</td><td>1</td><td>+1.50 亿</td><td>+265.95bp</td><td>单票驱动，非主线</td></tr>
<tr><td>影视院线</td><td>1</td><td>+3.31 亿</td><td>+242.90bp</td><td>AI应用/传媒 主线内</td></tr>
<tr><td>出版</td><td>3</td><td>+3.66 亿</td><td>+198.27bp</td><td>AI应用/传媒 主线内（3 只）</td></tr>
