>研究</span><span class="claim-source">旧版原文补充</span></div><p><a href="history_sources/lhb.html#claim-lhb-719ecdac36bc2ed5">历史来源 · 09-02 存档 上榜71 · 机构在场34只 · S/A出手21笔</a></p></div><div class="" id="claim-lhb-dfde6c1674916b6c"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-research">研究</span><span class="claim-source">旧版原文补充</span></div><p><a href="history_sources/lhb.html#claim-lhb-dfde6c1674916b6c">历史来源 · 09-01 存档 上榜64 · 机构在场30只 · S/A出手18笔</a></p></div><div class="" id="claim-lhb-8ae557140e730e49"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-research">研究</span><span class="claim-source">旧版原文补充</span></div><p><a href="history_sources/lhb.html#claim-lhb-8ae557140e730e49">历史来源 · 08-31 存档 上榜70 · 机构在场28只 · S/A出手31笔</a></p></div><div class="" id="claim-lhb-394b44a5bb8e0dd3"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-research">研究</span><span class="claim-source">旧版原文补充</span></div><p><a href="history_sources/lhb.html#claim-lhb-394b44a5bb8e0dd3">历史来源 · 08-28 存档 上榜51 · 机构在场18只 · S/A出手20笔</a></p></div><div class="" id="claim-lhb-f64d52974cee34fc"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-research">研究</span><span class="claim-source">旧版原文补充</span></div><p><a href="history_sources/lhb.html#claim-lhb-f64d52974cee34fc">历史来源 · 08-27 存档 上榜58 · 机构在场31只 · S/A出手32笔</a></p></div><div class="" id="claim-lhb-faff3f6741635c6c"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-research">研究</span><span class="claim-source">旧版原文补充</span></div><p><a href="history_sources/lhb.html#claim-lhb-faff3f6741635c6c">历史来源 · 08-26 存档 上榜58 · 机构在场28只 · S/A出手13笔</a></p></div><div class="" id="claim-lhb-963001d50c1b9307"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-research">研究</span><span class="claim-source">旧版原文补充</span></div><p><a href="history_sources/lhb.html#claim-lhb-963001d50c1b9307">历史来源 · 08-25 存档 上榜60 · 机构在场30只 · S/A出手13笔</a></p></div><div class="" id="claim-lhb-4ca14b4af838d0d4"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-research">研究</span><s